error[NK2105]: `source` is given to `??` inside a loop, but it was declared outside it.
   --> tests/a_narrowed_name_given_to_a_coalesce_in_a_loop_is_refused.nika:13:29
    |
 13 |         if source != null { keep(out, n.clone(), source ?? "") }
    |                             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = note: `source` is a `String?`, so it's handed over itself, not a copy - the next time round the loop it would be handed over again, but it's already gone.
    = note: Numbers, `bool`s, `scalar`s and views would be fine: they're copied.
    = help: Hand over a copy each time: `source?.clone()`.
